{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 2, "text": "至上百年积累起来的财产毁于一旦。因此，布依族中特别重视防火教育，每年三月三、六", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 249, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "至上百年积累起来的财产毁于一旦。因此，布依族中特别重视防火教育，每年三月三、六", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 249, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 3, "text": "月六都要举行扫火星仪式，并于神庙前由寨老宣布的寨民注意事项中，就有要求各户教", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 310, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "月六都要举行扫火星仪式，并于神庙前由寨老宣布的寨民注意事项中，就有要求各户教", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 310, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 4, "text": "育孩子不要玩火的内容。对故意纵火者，处罚也很严重，有体罚、罚钱罚物等。如册亨", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 374, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "育孩子不要玩火的内容。对故意纵火者，处罚也很严重，有体罚、罚钱罚物等。如册亨", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 374, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 5, "text": "“秧佑乡规碑”规定：", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 439, "w": 358, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“秧佑乡规碑”规定：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 439, "w": 358, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 6, "text": "“一不准纵火烧林，违者议该罚前一吊二。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 503, "w": 752, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“一不准纵火烧林，违者议该罚前一吊二。”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 503, "w": 752, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 7, "text": "布依族从大量刑事案件发生的现象中发现其根源在于赌博，因此，布依族习惯法中", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 567, "w": 1463, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族从大量刑事案件发生的现象中发现其根源在于赌博，因此，布依族习惯法中", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 567, "w": 1463, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 8, "text": "对禁赌都有相应规定。有的是在宗族的宗谱上规定禁赌的内容，更多的是在乡规碑中加", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 636, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "对禁赌都有相应规定。有的是在宗族的宗谱上规定禁赌的内容，更多的是在乡规碑中加", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 636, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 9, "text": "以规定。如兴义阿红大寨“乡规民约碑”规定：", "bbox_px": {"x": 144, "y": 694, "w": 801, "h": 63}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "以规定。如兴义阿红大寨“乡规民约碑”规定：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 144, "y": 694, "w": 801, "h": 63}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 10, "text": "“一议不准窝藏赌博。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 760, "w": 402, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“一议不准窝藏赌博。”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 760, "w": 402, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 11, "text": "册亨“马黑乡规碑”规定：", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 829, "w": 438, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "册亨“马黑乡规碑”规定：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 829, "w": 438, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 12, "text": "“一禁革不许赌钱。”", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 889, "w": 366, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“一禁革不许赌钱。”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 889, "w": 366, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 13, "text": "此外，布依族中对窝藏盗贼、包庇犯人等也作了相应处罚规定。", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 958, "w": 1089, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此外，布依族中对窝藏盗贼、包庇犯人等也作了相应处罚规定。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 958, "w": 1089, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 14, "text": "2.刑事案件的决断和处罚方式", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1022, "w": 551, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "2.刑事案件的决断和处罚方式", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1022, "w": 551, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 15, "text": "布依族中对刑事案件的审判、决断和处罚一般由寨老主持。其方式主要有以下几", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1086, "w": 1467, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族中对刑事案件的审判、决断和处罚一般由寨老主持。其方式主要有以下几", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1086, "w": 1467, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 16, "text": "种：", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1151, "w": 68, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "种：", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1151, "w": 68, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 17, "text": "首先，案件审理和对罪犯进行处罚的实施者，根据罪犯的具体情况，分别由寨老或宗", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1215, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "首先，案件审理和对罪犯进行处罚的实施者，根据罪犯的具体情况，分别由寨老或宗", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1215, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 18, "text": "族长老担任。", "bbox_px": {"x": 140, "y": 1277, "w": 234, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "族长老担任。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 140, "y": 1277, "w": 234, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 19, "text": "其次，审判和决断是根据人证物证进行的。布依族谚云：“拿贼拿赃，捉奸捉双。”人", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1340, "w": 1467, "h": 64}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "其次，审判和决断是根据人证物证进行的。布依族谚云：“拿贼拿赃，捉奸捉双。”人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1340, "w": 1467, "h": 64}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 20, "text": "赃俱在，再根据有关规约进行处罚。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1412, "w": 623, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "赃俱在，再根据有关规约进行处罚。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1412, "w": 623, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 21, "text": "第三，神判。这种审判方式是在缺少人证物证的情况下，利用人们惧怕神灵的心理，", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1477, "w": 1471, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第三，神判。这种审判方式是在缺少人证物证的情况下，利用人们惧怕神灵的心理，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1477, "w": 1471, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 22, "text": "借助神的力量进行的。主要有捞油锅、看鸡眼和对神起誓，等等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1541, "w": 1130, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "借助神的力量进行的。主要有捞油锅、看鸡眼和对神起誓，等等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 1541, "w": 1130, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 23, "text": "第三节 社交习俗", "bbox_px": {"x": 683, "y": 1698, "w": 462, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "第三节 社交习俗", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 683, "y": 1698, "w": 462, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 24, "text": "一、社交类型", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1866, "w": 229, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一、社交类型", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1866, "w": 229, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 25, "text": "除一般熟人、朋友等的社交外，在黔西南一些地方，还有一些固定的社交形式。如", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1931, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "除一般熟人、朋友等的社交外，在黔西南一些地方，还有一些固定的社交形式。如", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 1931, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 26, "text": "“古同”、“囊绍囊冒”、“古农”，等等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1992, "w": 643, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“古同”、“囊绍囊冒”、“古农”，等等。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1992, "w": 643, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 27, "text": "（一）“古同”", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 2055, "w": 230, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（一）“古同”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 2055, "w": 230, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 28, "text": "古同。这是青少年时期（偶有年长者），两人年龄相同或相近者相互交往的一种社交", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 2124, "w": 1459, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "古同。这是青少年时期（偶有年长者），两人年龄相同或相近者相互交往的一种社交", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 2124, "w": 1459, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 29, "text": "形式。儿童时代是天真活泼的时代，布依族的少年儿童从这时起就开始受到注重社交的", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2189, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "形式。儿童时代是天真活泼的时代，布依族的少年儿童从这时起就开始受到注重社交的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2189, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 30, "text": "风气的熏陶，并接受社交的基本训练。", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2253, "w": 659, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "风气的熏陶，并接受社交的基本训练。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2253, "w": 659, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 31, "text": "所谓“古同”，“古”直译为“做”，意为结交。“同”意为“伙伴”。因而“古同”可译为", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 2317, "w": 1459, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "所谓“古同”，“古”直译为“做”，意为结交。“同”意为“伙伴”。因而“古同”可译为", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 2317, "w": 1459, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 32, "text": "“结交同伴”。由于尚未成年，少年儿童之间的“古同”都是在长辈及同辈年长者的教导和", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 2378, "w": 1552, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“结交同伴”。由于尚未成年，少年儿童之间的“古同”都是在长辈及同辈年长者的教导和", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 2378, "w": 1552, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 33, "text": "安排下进行的。随着年龄的增长，一般社交的频繁，他们的经验逐步丰富起来，“古同“不", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2442, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "安排下进行的。随着年龄的增长，一般社交的频繁，他们的经验逐步丰富起来，“古同“不", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 2442, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 291, "line_no": 34, "text": "再需要长辈成年者的介绍了，而是在自己结交的朋友或认识的人中发现值得深交的对象", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2511, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "再需要长辈成年者的介绍了，而是在自己结交的朋友或认识的人中发现值得深交的对象", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 2511, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
